of the following statements are true? Use direct verification.\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Check $B$. The entry in row $1$, column $2$ already disproves the identity claim:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(AB)_{12}&=(1)(3)+(-2)(1)+(0)(0) \\\\ &=1\\ne 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $AB\\ne I_3$, so $B$ is not an inverse of $A$. One mismatching entry is enough to reject a candidate.\n\nThe statement $B=A^{-1}$ is **false** by the product test above.\n\nSelect None of the above."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186703858 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "55f28d1b-de90-5034-8539-6fa9101dc6a1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186703847} {:answer/id #uuid "5c4f3ad7-5c42-51bb-bf9a-750d87db791e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186703849}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186703847} :answer-field/id #uuid "23fd9c5b-3f51-54c3-8868-99ef3d3801cf" :answer-field/key "$B\\ne A^{-1}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186703842} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0fff7888-796a-5e3f-894f-81e718c50c86" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186703839} {:answer/id #uuid "c970b612-2229-5a66-8592-4992d1e9ddf0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186703867}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186703839} :answer-field/id #uuid "6b351673-8eb2-5b40-82ff-1075bdd044ba" :answer-field/key "$AB=BA=I_3$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186703855} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6a9c1bc4-0065-5066-9280-410875a788a5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186703854} {:answer/id #uuid "9e94ec04-80e3-57bc-b12c-5adc15b968ae" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "